    a skos:Collection ;
    rdfs:label "NVIS Major Vegetation Groups" ;
    dcterms:description "A collection of the Major Vegetation Groups (MVG) identified as per the National Vegetation Information System (NVIS). The MVGs listed are MVG 12, 13, 14, 15 up to MVG 32. For e.g., MVG 12 (Tropical Eucalypt Woodlands/grasslands) and MVG 32 (Mallee open Woodlands and Sparse Mallee Shrublands)." ;
    dcterms:relation "NVIS Technical Working Group (2017) Australian Vegetation Attribute Manual: National Vegetation Information System, Version 7.0. Department of the Environment and Energy, Canberra. Prep by Bolton, M.P., deLacey, C. and Bossard, K.B. (Eds)" ;
