    a skos:Collection ;
    rdfs:label "NVIS Major Vegetation Sub-groups" ;
    dcterms:description "A collection of the Major Vegetation Sub-groups identified as per the National Vegetation Information System (NVIS). Some examples include Tropical Eucalypt Woodlands/grasslands, Mallee open Woodlands and Sparse Mallee Shrublands, Northern and Southern Mangroves, and the ones listed as a sub-group under the major vegetation groups on the NVIS." ;
    dcterms:relation "NVIS Technical Working Group (2017) Australian Vegetation Attribute Manual: National Vegetation Information System, Version 7.0. Department of the Environment and Energy, Canberra. Prep by Bolton, M.P., deLacey, C. and Bossard, K.B. (Eds)" ;
